Bugs/Incomplete

Here's a bug:
If I enter a FP: KRNT SEA V2 ELN KYKM
and then activate the leg SEA -> VAMPS,
and then delete KRNT, the active leg becomes VAMPS->BANDR.
That suggests the active leg is being computed/recomputed as an index into
an array that just changed out from under it.
I thought we carefully assigned row-uids to the flight plan elements
exactly so we could avoid this class of bug?
Write a test case, then fix this in a general, robust way that isn't
"try to put the pieces back together after the damage" and more "if the
operation didn't destroy the rows involved in the active leg, then it should
be pretty damn obvious where the active leg still is."


