up through status pills to a top-level status pill. When we click on it,
it opens a page with the active warnings.

Warnings include:
- Procedure contains procedure turn; confirm it stays within plate limits
- {ADSB, NEXRAD, METAR} data is old
data age cautions for NEXRAD, METARs, ADSB, NOTAMs, TFRs.


